Third-party assets
==================

The UR5e model, meshes and reference MJCF under
``mujoco_sim/assets/ur5e/`` come from the MuJoCo Menagerie
(``universal_robots_ur5e``) and are distributed under the BSD-3-Clause
license reproduced in ``mujoco_sim/assets/ur5e/LICENSE``:

    Copyright 2018 ROS Industrial Consortium

They are not covered by the repository's MIT license; the BSD-3-Clause terms
apply to those files.

The piCOBOT Electric / B30-2 cup / yellow collar geometry is a procedural
approximation built from public Piab dimensions.  All tool and payload meshes
generated by ``mujoco_sim/meshgen.py`` are original assets of this repository.

The piCOBOT and Piab names are trademarks of their respective owners and are
used here only to describe the modelled hardware.
